text @[Tomoya]
text Well...
text What can I say to deceive him...?
text @[Tomoya]
text It's because it looked like we were going to have to do a band for to school festival.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's all.
text I say as I tamper with the radio tuner.
text After some noise, the radio switches to live coverage of a professional baseball game.
text @[Yoshino]
text ...
text Yoshino-san doesn't say anything else.
text I wonder if he was just casually reminded of the past.
sound ~
if rtf1 != ""
	jump $rtf1 $rtl1
fi
jump $rtf0 $rtl0
label 20
text @[Tomoya]
text It's probably just as you think.
sound QE0.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text So he was the instigator?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes. His little sister was a fan, apparently...
sound QE1.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Hm...
text @[Tomoya]
text But, I also started to like you, so much that I even bought your CD after that...
text Just why am I making excuses here...?
text What did I say that day?
text Something like me not being a fan, so I don't care how he takes my words?
text And look at me now... all flustered like this...
text It's so ironic...
text Right now, we are professional senpai and kouhai.
text To have him find out about what happened back then, after having gotten this close to each other...
sound QE2.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Why, thank you.
text @[Yoshino]
text ...
text ...This is so damn awkward.
choice Change the channel|Sing
