music BGM01.mp3
sound QE7.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Long ago...
sound QE8.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text There was an ill-mannered boy living in this town.
sound QE9.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He had no parents, so ever since he was little, he'd only learned bad things... and he only ever did whatever he wanted.
sound QEA.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Being reckless felt comfortable to him.
sound QEB.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He had his first encounter with music at the age of thirteen.
sound QEC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That was the time of the Band Boom... and all the boy's friends had taken an interest in music.
sound QED.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text So the boy snatched a guitar from someone, and started playing.
sound QEE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He copied various European styles.
sound QEF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He even started to enjoy singing.
sound QEG.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He would barge into other people's performances and snatch away the microphone.
sound QEH.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text At that time, too, he still felt comfortable being reckless.
sound QEI.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text However, by then, that was no longer a bad thing.
sound QEJ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's right... that was simply what rock was.
sound QEK.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Shouting, breaking things, jumping into a sea of people...
sound QEL.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text No matter what he did, all of the boy's recklessnesses would be tolerated there.
sound QEM.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text If he could just live his life holding onto that, he could start living without being talked about behind his back anymore.
sound QEN.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Of course, he'd occasionally let loose as well.
sound QEO.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text However, the people around him would only laugh whenever he did.
sound QEP.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Even when he entered high school, the time where everyone thinks solely about entering university, the boy was immersed in music.
sound QEQ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I'll make my living off my music. That's what he thought.
sound QER.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That was the only thing on his mind.
sound QES.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Because if he did anything else other than music, he would lose his footing in life.
sound QET.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Even if he himself would never consider himself as having lost his footing... society would still reproach him for having done so.
sound QEU.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text They would think of what he did as wrong, and try to correct him.
sound QEV.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text If he didn't do music, there wouldn't be anyone around him to laugh.
sound QEW.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's why, at the end of his second year, the boy had made up his mind.
