sound QEX.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text At the start of his third year, he had an encounter.
sound QEY.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text It was with a female teacher who had recently started working at the school.
sound QEZ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text The boy was singing and playing guitar in an empty classroom, not caring what people thought about him, when she walked in like a stray child.
sound QF0.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text She applauded for him, said he was really good.
sound QF1.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He'd been singing a love song.
sound QF2.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text The lyrics were just embarrassing, but...
sound QF3.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text The woman sincerely understood their meaning.
sound QF4.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Even after that, the two continued talking about the song.
sound QF5.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Then people started calling her via the PA, and she finally remembered she'd actually been on her way to her next class.
sound QF6.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text She seemed wise, but she was actually quite clumsy.
sound QF7.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text After that, the boy and the woman talked to each other many times.
sound QF8.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text His female classmates had all laughed at him, saying that there's no way he could make a living off his music.
sound QF9.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text However, she was different.
sound VYX.aac
text "...Your dream will come true as long as you keep at it, so don't quit, okay?"
sound QFA.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text She told him, as she held his hands.
sound QFB.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He'd fallen in love with her.
sound QFC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He hadn't had all that much opportunity to talk with her, but once they started talking, their conversations would just keep on going...
sound QFD.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text and even a poor speaker like him was able to talk about a lot of things...
sound QFE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That woman brought out the best in him.
sound QFF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text On the day they parted, this is what he told the female teacher.
sound QFG.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "I'll definitely go pro and become famous."
sound QFH.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "So when I do... please go out with me."
sound QFI.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text She agreed without hesitation.
sound QFJ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Maybe she thought it was impossible for him to become a professional...
sound QFK.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text But even so, the boy would be fine with that.
sound QFL.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Because the music he had depended on turned into a goal.
sound QFM.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And so, believing he would definitely make his living off his music...
sound QFN.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text The boy left this town after he graduated, and went to the capital.
