sound QFQ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He went to an audition.
sound QFR.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And although he didn't make the cut... the judges awarded him a special prize, and just like that, he was heading off to his debut.
sound QFS.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text It had been so easy, it was almost anti-climactic.
sound QFT.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text However, it was that moment that his dream had come true.
sound QFU.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "Take that!" he thought at the people who had rebuked him.
sound QFV.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "Now I'll be able to live my life, unseparated from music..."
sound QFW.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Thinking that, the boy felt relieved.
sound QFX.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text After that, his life became frantic.
sound QFY.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Everything became about his music.
sound QFZ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text It had always been hard for him to relax and deal with things.
sound QG0.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's why he sang what he wanted to sing, with everything he had.
sound QG1.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text At times, he would sing like he was spitting out the lyrics.
sound QG2.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He would sing in weeping tones.
sound QG3.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He would even sing ugly things.
sound QG4.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text But it's exactly because they were ugly, that he sang them with that much more vigor.
sound QG5.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And when he did, it looked beautiful.
sound QG6.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Living itself started looking vibrant.
sound QG7.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's because living itself is the ugliest thing of all...
sound QG8.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text It also gave birth to an incredible amount of strength.
sound QG9.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text The first time he gave a live performance...
sound QGA.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Or perhaps the first time his records went on sale, and fans all over the country were listening to him all at once...
sound QGB.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Ever since that day, he gave birth to a strength that enabled people to live strongly...
sound QGC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text It's what they call "empathy."
sound QGD.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text People empathized with his songs, deriving from them the strength to live.
sound QGE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Of course it wouldn't be the sole thing in their lives, but it definitely helped people.
sound QGF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He'd experienced that himself firsthand.
sound QGG.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Until the day he encountered music, he was a good-for-nothing person who would hurt others, and even himself...
sound QGH.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Someone who hadn't ever been considerate of others...
sound QGI.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text So now, having found his meaning in life, the boy vowed in his heart that this was the role he wanted to fulfill.
sound QGJ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text However... that was the last time everything would be going well.
