text He continued distressing himself over this.
sound QHO.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He couldn't sing. And he couldn't write songs.
sound QHP.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text The record company told him to take a break for a while.
sound QHQ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He'd been frantically recording songs and doing performances ever since he'd made his debut, after all...
sound QHR.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text So it was only natural he was tired.
sound QHS.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He spent his time in idleness, not even enjoying the rare break from work...
sound QHT.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text About half a year had passed.
sound QHU.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text One of the people he'd met via the program...
