sound QK8.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And there...
sound QK9.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text ...he had a reunion.
sound QKA.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text He stepped down from the bus...
sound QKB.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text ...and as he staggered onward like some sleepwalker, with no possessions of his own... there, at the end of his path...
sound QKC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text ...was the female teacher from that day.
sound QKD.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text It was a complete coincidence.
sound QKE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And to him... it was the worst thing that could have happened.
sound QKF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "How cruel is this world...?"
sound QKG.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "Do you have to go that far to torment me...?"
sound QKH.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "Right in front of the person I professed my dreams to..."
sound QKI.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "I committed these crimes, destroyed my dreams... Just why did she have to appear...?"
sound QKJ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "Does this town hate me...?"
sound QKK.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "Is that how heavy my crimes are...?"
sound QKL.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "That you have to smash my mind to bits like this...?"
sound QKM.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text "Really, I just want to end it all..."
sound QKN.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's what he thought.
sound QKO.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text But...
sound QKP.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That person just continued smiling at him gently...
sound QKQ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And she asked him...
music ~
sound QKR.aac
text Are you still continuing your music?
sound QKS.aac
text ...Your dream will come true as long as you keep at it, so don't quit, okay?
sound QKT.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Hearing those words...
