sound QLC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That reminds me, the high school you went to was the prep school at the top of the hill, wasn't it...?
text As I enter the truck, Yoshino-san asks me as if he just casually remembered.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
sound QLD.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I believe that woman used to teach there, actually...
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh? Seriously? Then I've met her?
sound QLE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text No, probably not... you graduated in the spring of last year, didn't you?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
sound QLF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I suppose you just missed each other, then. She quit the moment you enrolled.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh...
text @[Tomoya]
text Is it all right if I hear her name just in case, though?
sound QLG.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Hm? Sure...
sound QLH.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text She's called Ibuki. You probably don't know it.
if intF[29] == 0
	goto s38
fi
goto 44
label s38
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah... I don't.
sound QLI.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's what I thought.
sound QLJ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Well, it would be different if you repeated a year or something.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
sound QLK.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text What? You actually repeated a year?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, not me...
text @[Tomoya]
text But my girlfriend did...
sound QLL.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Wha?
sound QLM.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text But isn't she still in school right now? Even if she's in the third year, shouldn't she be around the same age as you?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, she's actually repeated twice now...
text Though she'd probably get pretty mad if she found out I've been blabbing away her secrets.
sound QLN.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Seriously...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Ibuki... san, was it?
sound QLO.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Whatever...
text It seems he regrets having told me everything, believing we wouldn't have any common ground anyway.
text I guess I'll ask Nagisa once I get back home.
