text I'd thought Nagisa might think his music is a bit too noisy, but it appears she liked it.
text Yoshino-san's songs may be loud, but the melodies themselves are quite approachable and melancholy.
text That part of them must have struck Nagisa's heartstrings too.
text @[Tomoya]
text You know, though, Yoshino-san was even younger than I am now when he released this CD.
