sound QME.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But once I listened to this, I found myself wanting to tell her what I think of it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Her, and not the artist himself?
sound QMF.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes... because you said it yourself... The artist, Yoshino-san...
sound QMG.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text He's gone through a lot of things...
sound QMH.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text It might be that he doesn't want people to pry too much.
sound QMI.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text And I think I'd be able to find out if I ask Ibuki-sensei...
sound QMJ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Of course, I won't ask for all the details...
text He barely just got to the point with me where he could freely speak of his past.
text He probably won't take it favourably if some stranger he barely knows suddenly told him their impressions of his song.
text @[Tomoya]
text I see... I guess that makes sense.
text @[Tomoya]
text You go do that.
text That's why this is how I answer her.
