text Of course.
text @[Tomoya]
text You know what I'm asking you to help with, then?
sound QMY.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You're a kind person, Tomoya-kun, so it's obvious.
sound QMZ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You want Yoshino-san to go back to making CDs so people will listen to him again.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, exactly.
text It was a stupid question on my part.
